        "body": {
          "size": 2606,
          "base64_url_content": null,
          "content": "<div style=\"font:16px/1.6 Arial,sans-serif;color:#0e1a22;max-width:640px\"><p>The archival Momentum design system and all five interactive ebooks are ready for your review.</p><p><a href=\"https://claude.ai/code/artifact/e9ce7032-81b1-4970-9aca-4d39a23eafc0\">Open the private Claude Design collection</a>. Choose an Ebook page from the Pages menu, then select Play interactive artboard.</p><p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1vM5-p9J3aDGVRERpTR3IpDKn_-qkjwCS/view\">Download all five interactive books, PDF companions and editable source</a>. Extract the entire ZIP, then open an ebook HTML file. The five static PDFs total 174 pages.</p><ol><li><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1i1x7sGYGRLGm2sIa_5m4nlO8KDHqT6H_/view\">Show Up When They Ask AI</a></li><li><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1b1w7XpZJJJFqihIOi6goVAgb662ffWSS/view\">From Missed Call to Booked Job</a></li><li><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1TP24dA1vWFZdBQ71NLEmXBmliLclMYbV/view\">Built Not Prompted</a></li><li><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1KuPM-LpcGVyFUwLufbQKkP32BKfCUdon/view\">The Small Business AI Operating System</a></li><li><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ni-pSa5Jz3PlHt0IEcW8OKeu9JLH06bH/view\">Names Not Numbers</a></li></ol><p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1po121uPblmE-cCUoe3TV1DMUxpX0K2IV/view\">Download the updated archival brand system</a><br><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1aP9W2GMRCWba_PL0G4Tjt0RQGjoVbEF2/view\">View the updated brand reference PDF</a></p><p>The system now includes 38 SVG icons: 12 agent roles, 16 marketing icons and the original ten foundation icons. Your references guide the ivory paper, inset plates, engraved details, layered notes and type motion. The exact Momentum logo files are included.</p><p>Native chapter navigation, source controls, motion pause, diagram selection and a worksheet state change were verified in the authenticated artifact. The earlier preview failures are corrected. The books retain their manuscript review notes and proposed claims and pricing remain subject to content approval. The native reading font uses the documented fallback to keep the preview responsive.</p><p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1JVqi6mnxFh3Wx8RbStvIrHTVut6iHqtw/view\">Download 18 planning and article text drafts</a>. These are supporting text drafts, separate from the designed ebook editions.</p><p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1vWStEWFL4atcb2bccygvXRizPq2ynmik\">Open the complete private delivery library</a>. The video and artwork links from the previous email remain available there.</p></div>",
